      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: i'm not sure if the issue still here, but since it's related, here we go: in the past if you've created a loop between two states enabling Temporary Pose Space, without Exit Time and Transition set to 0, and then change to another world while the loop is still active, the game just crashes.\n\nare you devs working on this issue? it's been a long time since it was first reported and nothing has been done yet (even though the issue is tagged Tracked in other posts)\n\nit may seem a harmless issue, but it was really cool to make the viewpoint smooth during walking/crouch/prone animations using the TPS loop, and with these new two bugs we have to remove it almost completely from our avatars.",
