      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Notice the Same Problem even if other People using it.\n\nIm most time AFK in the Idle Home World and there are many people using the Busy Home Avatar what has the Same function with Rapidly Triggering Temporary Pose Space.\n\nIts even goes so far that it let other people crash if they have a Weaker PC or even on Quest.\n\nAnd its on the both versions (Open Beta and Release)\n\n---\n\nAdded the Avatar that cousing a lot of crashes so far because of the Pose Space Function\n\n---\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_ca4ee0d7-7bcc-4cdf-beff-119b76dc2199",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-08T12:06:28.487Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The more people in the room, or the lower your fps is, the faster the problem will manifest itself.\n\nTo reproduce, you need to create a loop between two States that activate the Temporary Pose Space, without Exit Time and Transition set to 0. Enable the loop in-game and with time your fps will start to drop more and more, it can take seconds to minutes depending on your fps.\n\nChanging avatars temporarily returns the avatar to normal state, but soon the lag will intensify again.",
